Note 1 & 0.1 Release note - September 20th 22:41 Brasilia Time Zone

Now starting a new development stage, switching to 32 bits

But before that, i'm going to release the Pre-Beta Build 2026-9_01 (1st Build of September 2026).
Do not expect much of it because the only thing it does is "display text", no keyboard/mouse input. just TEXT (it only displays "Booting CrystalOS")

But from Pre-Beta Build 2026-9_03 on, it will throw away just being a text operating system, it will get a "window type of terminal" which you can type commands such as

  help = command list
  version = CrystalOS Pre-Beta Build 2026-9_0X, compiled on September XX, 2026
  clear = clears terminal

  more commands coming soon!


